<title>DUBAI: Oman cuts November crude price to $21.80 - official.</title>
<headline>Oman cuts November crude price to $21.80 - official.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman has cut the price of its crude lifted in November by $0.70 a barrel to $21.80, an official at Oman's Ministry of Petroleum and Minerals said.</p>
<p>Oman, a major non-OPEC producer, retroactively sets its crude price every month.</p>
</text>
